{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：23:00 2026-06-29 HKT<br/>發佈時間：23:00 2026-06-29 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：23:00 2026-06-29 HKT</p><p>油麻地新填地街30號對開，周一（6月29日）晚上8時許，警員發現路邊一部寶馬私家車內，有3名可疑男子，遂上前截查。其後，警方在車上發現一批「依托咪酯」煙彈及可卡因，相信涉事車輛為「毒品快餐車」，遂將3男拘捕。</p><p>目前毒品市值及來源仍待調查，有探員在私家車蒐證，並在車身上套取指模。</p><img alt=\"現場為油麻地新填地街30號對開。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/10b2ccd0eacf27c77d3f1511e06f4945/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_22_18_05.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員在車上蒐證。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/68373f7b67e9f10812de3f44a526d508/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_22_18_07_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員在車上蒐證。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2e3c785d2b02da26ee8727e48f56f5ba/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_22_18_08.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員在車身上套取指模。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8de7b9f56709d4bda9f8459c2662e24a/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_22_18_08_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員在車身上套取指模。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/27695ab19defe8b0aa8d76e5e2372a90/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-29_at_22_18_06_1_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-29T15:38:43.638639+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":222,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}